        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deadcam is a first-person psychological horror game where you can see a reactive live-feed facecam of the very thing you must survive. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/395fab9e7454cf0d3a45829a31f26638.poster.avif?t=1762355087\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/395fab9e7454cf0d3a45829a31f26638.webm?t=1762355087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/395fab9e7454cf0d3a45829a31f26638.mp4?t=1762355087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sealed shut inside a rural, abandoned house for a paranormal hunting TV show.. Something becomes VERY wrong with your crew member Margo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/9516916171cb8cdcd391919658f0983b.poster.avif?t=1762355087\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/9516916171cb8cdcd391919658f0983b.webm?t=1762355087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/9516916171cb8cdcd391919658f0983b.mp4?t=1762355087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her live headcam is still rolling.. and you can see the whole thing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/78f5fdfb4b5ae39958d1cdac1d0c6982.poster.avif?t=1762355087\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/78f5fdfb4b5ae39958d1cdac1d0c6982.webm?t=1762355087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/78f5fdfb4b5ae39958d1cdac1d0c6982.mp4?t=1762355087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, and escape the house in this first-person survival horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/2f17cc34f75ccc7e1e8de0f69b6cb607.poster.avif?t=1762355087\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/2f17cc34f75ccc7e1e8de0f69b6cb607.webm?t=1762355087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/2f17cc34f75ccc7e1e8de0f69b6cb607.mp4?t=1762355087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember: the raccoon knows everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEADCAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a rural, abandoned house in the great wilderness, three amateur ghost hunters lock themselves inside to film a new episode for their failing paranormal hunting TV show <i>'The Ghoul Hunters.'</i> Desperate for higher ratings, the shows producer Dom will do whatever it takes to raise the stakes and keep the show alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But things take a turn for the worst almost instantly - and it's already too late. Something is <strong>very</strong> wrong with Margo. Dom fled and sealed the exit to keep Margo contained, leaving you for dead with her. And when you see Margo, you might wish you were. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Margo's live headcam is still rolling: you can see her <strong>reactive</strong> face the whole time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for any creaky floorboards and don't make too much noise: <strong>Margo can hear your movements.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Margo's face will respond to <strong>your characters actions.</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>sneak, hide, and escape</strong> the house. And whatever you do, <strong>stay away from Margo.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust the <strong>Raccoon</strong>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you make it out alive - or will you become the final episode that never aired? If you want to survive.. The Raccoon may be your only ally.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>...DIFFERENCES BETWEEN THE DEMO AND THE FULL GAME? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The full game has been hugely updated and improved from the demo. Amongst many other tweaks, updates and changes, the full game has:</i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extended gameplay.</strong> The full game has a much longer play time and is much more in depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>general entire overhaul and improvement</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ‘<strong>Reciever</strong>’ mechanic. Pressing [1] after obtaining the Receiver will emit a pulsing light and beep from Margo’s headcam to help identify where she is. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ‘<strong>Tablet</strong>’ mechanic. Pressing [SHIFT] after obtaining the Tablet will pull up a real-time tablet screen, to see a clearer and bigger view of Margo’s headcam. This can be used along with the Receiver for an even better understanding of where she is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiding places</strong> are now more clear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Textures + materials</strong> quality improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UI improvements</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound design</strong> improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lighting quality</strong> improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New, more <strong>distinctive lights</strong> have been placed around the house level, to more easily distinguish where Margo is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are now <strong>Steam Achievements</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More <strong>Post-It Notes</strong> can be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 secret, <strong>hidden collectables</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easter Eggs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHOTO SENSITIVITY WARNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game may include occasional, mild slow flashes, lightning effects, and VHS-style visual distortion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/1c96fecf5afd7afcc13cd17f90ed35ed.avif?t=1762355087\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Alien Big Cat. Solo developer. Psychological thriller / horror games. MORE games coming soon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
